@startuml Login

title Punchclock - Login (JWT Authentication)

actor User
participant Browser
participant AuthController
participant AuthService
participant ApplicationUserRepository
database Database

User -> Browser : Enter username and password

Browser -> AuthController : POST /auth/login\n(username, password)

AuthController -> AuthService : login(username, password)

AuthService -> ApplicationUserRepository : findByUsername(username)

ApplicationUserRepository -> Database : SELECT user WHERE username = ?
Database --> ApplicationUserRepository : ApplicationUser / null

ApplicationUserRepository --> AuthService : ApplicationUser / null

alt User exists and password is correct
    AuthService -> AuthService : Verify password hash
    AuthService -> AuthService : Generate signed JWT

    AuthService --> AuthController : JWT
    AuthController --> Browser : 200 OK + JWT

    Browser -> Browser : Store JWT
    Browser --> User : Login successful
else Invalid credentials
    AuthService --> AuthController : Authentication failed
    AuthController --> Browser : 401 Unauthorized

    Browser --> User : Display error message
end

@enduml